@791 = ~Void Weapon~
@792 = ~Void Weapon (Evocation)
Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: 3 rounds / 2 levels
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell creates a planar tear in the hands of the mage, which he shapes into a weapon he knows how to use. The blade cannot leave his hand for the duration of the spell, unless replaced by another weapon shaped in the same way. This weapon made of void destroys everything that comes into contact with it. It effortlessly penetrates the strongest armor, and gives a +4 bonus to hit. It atomizes the matter around what it hits, inflicting an additional 2D6+4 points of damage. Finally it can completely disintegrate the victim it affects, if it fails a save vs. death at +4.

Note: don't create a two-handed sword or a halberd if you are equipped with a shield; this inconsistency would crash the game. If you want such a weapon, remove your shield first.~
