@795 = ~Camouflage~
@796 = ~Camouflage (Illusion)
Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: 3 rounds + 1 round / level
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

Like level 5 spell Invisibility, this spell makes the warlord undetectable by sight and gives bonuses to defense and saving throws. But the spell Camouflage additionally gives perfect concealment, hiding everything that could reveal the presence of the warlord. Thus his footsteps, his body heat, his breathing, etc., everything is artificially hidden. However, he may let his voice be heard if he wishes to speak. Camouflage also protects against detection, divination and enhanced vision.~
