@7911 = ~Incendiary Cloud~
@7912 = ~Incendiary Cloud (Evocation)
Level: 9
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: cloud 9-meter radius
Saving Throw: half

This spell creates a billowing cloud of roaring flame. Any creature in the area must leave the cloud immediately, or suffer 1D4 points of fire damage per level of the caster each round while in the area of effect with a save each round for half damage.~
@79121 = ~Incendiary Cloud (Evocation)
Level: 9
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: cloud 9-meter radius
Saving Throw: half

This spell creates a billowing cloud of roaring flame. Any creature in the area must leave the cloud immediately, or suffer 20D4 points of fire damage each round while in the area of effect with a save each round for half damage.~

@7913 = ~Drought~
@7914 = ~Drought (Transmutation)
Level: 9
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: sphere 12-meter radius
Saving Throw: half

This spell subjects the chosen area to oppressive heat, like a desert exposed to 2 years of sun without a drop of rain. All life in the area becomes severely dehydrated. All plants, livestock, animals and creatures that have less than 5HD are instantly killed. The survivors will suffer 1D8 points of damage per level of the warlord (25D8 maximum). A save vs. spell halves the damage.~
@79141 = ~Drought (Transmutation)
Level: 9
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: sphere 12-meter radius
Saving Throw: half

This spell subjects the chosen area to oppressive heat, like a desert exposed to 2 years of sun without a drop of rain. All life in the area becomes severely dehydrated. All plants, livestock, animals and creatures that have less than 5HD are instantly killed. The survivors will suffer 1D8 points of damage per level of the warlord (25D8 maximum). A save vs. spell halves the damage.~

@7915 = ~Transformigration~
@7916 = ~Transformigration (Transmutation)
Level: 9
Range: caster
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: special
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

The warlord discovered this useful but costly spell while seeking a way to cast magic spontaneously.
This spell reshapes the energy stored in memorized spells into any spell the caster knows, at three times the normal energy cost.
In fact, once casting begins, the wizard may choose any spell he knows, which is then cast when the incantation ends. The energy cost makes him forget Transformigration and two other chosen spells among the highest-level spells still memorized.
Casting Time of this spell depends directly upon the spell that the warlord wants to cast: it matches casting time of the latter.~
@79161 = ~Transformigration (Transmutation)
Level: 9
Range: caster
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: special
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

The warlord discovered this useful but costly spell while seeking a way to cast magic spontaneously.
This spell reshapes the energy stored in memorized spells into any spell the caster knows, at twice the normal energy cost.
In fact, once casting begins, the wizard may choose any spell he knows, which is then cast when the incantation ends. The energy cost makes him forget Transformigration and one other chosen spell from among the highest-level spells he still has memorized.
Casting Time of this spell depends directly upon the spell that the warlord wants to cast: it matches casting time of the latter.~

@7917 = ~Vaporization~
@7918 = ~Vaporization (Evocation, Alteration)
Level: 9
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: special

This spell completely destroys the target creature. When the casting is finished, a column of raw magic surrounds the creature, tearing apart its entire being and merging it with the surrounding magic. If it fails a save vs. spell at -6 it is vaporized, transformed into magical particles that disappear along with the column. If the saving throw is successful, the resulting metabolic shock deals 10D10 points of damage.~
